ter;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/user/neonglitch/ooVn_RmUJfqX6gYnR3zN3j0nnYNpqG0EnM">NeonGlitch's Amino Page</a></span> by NeonGlitch</p> <span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(330, 50%, 25%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(330, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);"><em>Bobble The Clown</em></span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/blog/bobble-the-clown/b37l_w0houBVeEY0qKkaQWkwpPemYkdNw6"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/collab:drakimoto:art-stuff/neon1.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="neon1.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(190, 25%, 50%, 1) 0%, hsla(190, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);"><em>Dr Glass</em></span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/blog/dr-glass/gE46_aNU6uq8G731bw3wKloarJZ4lr3v60"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/collab:drakimoto:art-stuff/neon2.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="neon2.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(30, 50%, 25%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(30, 25%, 50%, 1) 50%);"><em>SCP-166 Rewrite</em></span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/blog/my-thoughts-on-the-scp-166-rewrite/0YaE_MbFkuKLEB2aBjxkbo3gYvg7MYVle5"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/collab:drakimoto:art-stuff/neon3.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="neon3.jpg" class="image" /></a></span> <hr /> <p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-size:larger;"><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/user/machiavellian-semi-hiatus/evD2_RoFmfd36Na7Kzo1j6zxQoKnvazjLnUQ">Machiavellian's Amino Page</a></span> by Machiavellian</p> <span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 0%, 25%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 0%, 50%, 1) 50%);"><em>Queen Coronation</em></span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/blog/queen-coronation-fanart/Movr_k4UkueKMdJGYpoDWq4dnzpn2KkjqX"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/collab:drakimoto:art-stuff/mach1.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="mach1.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 0%, 25%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 0%, 50%, 1) 50%);"><em>This Means War</em></span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/blog/this-means-war-fanart/WMoB_2gSXuRXxMK71dVN0Jp0jbzj13rdk0"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/collab:drakimoto:art-stuff/mach2.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="mach2.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><span class="hover"><span style="background: radial-gradient(ellipse at bottom right, hsla(0, 0%, 25%, 0.75) 0%, hsla(0, 0%, 50%, 1) 50%);"><em>Oh Here We Go Again</em></span><a href="https://aminoapps.com/c/scp-foundation/page/blog/oh-here-we-go-again/81QM_DZsmunZr58r7dPbx1xXqXm3LvM6rX"><img src="http://smlt.wikidot.com/local--files/collab:drakimoto:art-stuff/mach3.jpg" style="width:33%;" alt="mach3.jpg" class="image" /></a></span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <h1><span>Q&amp;A:</span></h1> <h2><span>Q: Can I replace a blurb that you wrote for one of my articles with my own? I'm not satisfied with it.</span></h2> <p>A: Absolutely. You will always have that option at any point.</p> <h2><span>Q: I noticed an error/typo/incorrect information and wish to correct it. May I?</span></h2> <p>A: Sure! If the changes are not limited to your own article(s) and/or are substantial changes across multiple entries, you should post in that month's discussion page and then make the changes.</p> <h2><span>Q: I wrote an article and it seems to have stuck. Can I send a blurb of mine to one of the frequent collaborators?</span></h2> <p>A: Yup! It's much easier if you come to us about it, and it gives you the control over what you want shown on the news page.</p> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><strong>« <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/news-10-2020">October 2020</a> | <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/news-11-2020">November 2020</a></span> | <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/news-12-2020">December 2020</a> »</strong></p> </div> <p><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span><br /> <span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></p> <hr /> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3487700&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608582168" alt="Uncle Nicolini" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3487700)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/uncle-nicolini" >Uncle Nicolini</a></span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">Footnotes</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-11221-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. with a rating above 0</div> </div> 
