				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tabview-31bba56f6cb351a080373f7c5f139022&quot; class=&quot;yui-navset&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;yui-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;selected&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Profile&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Contributions&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Favourites&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Others&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;yui-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hey, I&#039;m &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6438262&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608582168&quot; alt=&quot;Sirslash47&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6438262)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47&quot;  &gt;Sirslash47&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;. Often also called Sirslash or Slash.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I first came into contact with the SCP-wiki a few years ago. Most likely somewhere between 2012-2014 but perhaps even sooner. I&#039;d say somewhere in 2012 but I wouldn&#039;t bet on it. After 2014 I definitely knew what the wiki was. I kind of had an on-off thing where I remembered it and forgot it again.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I joined in May 2020 because I remembered that I could actually apply. I actually could have joined years sooner. But I&#039;m glad that I&#039;m here now. I see myself as a mediocre member of the wiki and user of the chat.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I hope I can build towards others their experience here in general. Thank you, for checking out my author page.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-1&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;SCP&#039;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5147&quot;&gt;SCP-5147&lt;/a&gt; &amp;quot;The Mannequin Troupe&amp;quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5927&quot;&gt;SCP-5927&lt;/a&gt; &amp;quot;The Norther&#039; Light Phantom&amp;quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Tales&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A small poetry page: &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/from-syllables-to-lines-to-imagination&quot;&gt;From syllables to lines to imagination&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000;&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;Miscellaneous&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;I added the heartwarming and tearjerkers lists in the &lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/user-curated-lists&quot;&gt;User Curated Lists&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-2&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 0px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I can&#039;t say that I have a favourite SCP but I think this one deserves more recognition.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/scp-5364&quot;&gt;SCP-5364&lt;/a&gt; &amp;quot;Seventy Millimeter Projector&amp;quot; by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5813664&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608582168&quot; alt=&quot;PlaguePJP&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5813664)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/plaguepjp&quot;  &gt;PlaguePJP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best tale I ever had.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/ambrose-gloucester&quot;&gt;Ambrose Gloucester: Best You Ever Had&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/riemann&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1787775&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608582168&quot; alt=&quot;Riemann&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1787775)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/riemann&quot;  &gt;Riemann&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I will put more works here over time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;wiki-tab-0-3&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;border:solid 1px #999999; background:#F0F8FF; padding:5px; margin-bottom: 5px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things I might do in the future:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;Complete the gift-exchange&lt;/span&gt; Gift already send in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enter a contest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do a flight to better my critique skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create or involve myself in a hub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6438262&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608582168&quot; alt=&quot;Sirslash47&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6438262)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sirslash47&quot;  &gt;Sirslash47&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
