					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/ralliston-s-authorpage</guid>
				<title>Ralliston&#039;s Authorpage</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/ralliston-s-authorpage</link>
				<description>


&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;Happy holidays!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If by any chance you clicked the link to this page, it probably means you read one of my articles. How about you learn who I am then? I&#039;m &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5986843&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608582169&quot; alt=&quot;Ralliston&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5986843)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ralliston&quot;  &gt;Ralliston&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-433180-1&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;, an amateur writer and a Junior Staff member of the Collections Team and Introductions Subteam of the Community Outreach Team on the SCP Wiki.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m a very proud owner of two of the bestest girls, Fiffy and Franny&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-433180-2&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; (of Fifka and Franka, as dog names don&#039;t translate well), a giant science-nerd, and an unhealthy fan of Queen and David Bowie. I&#039;ve been a book worm and a piano player since I can really remember, and as you might see, my writing is inspired by different books by a long shot. I don&#039;t really write a lot of memorable things here, but hopefully if I keep my pace I&#039;ll write something people will talk about some time in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more personal stuff if you want to know that for some reason, I&#039;m 18, I come from Poland and go by he/him. Small trivia you&#039;ll probably not care much for, I&#039;m the guy who suggested the &amp;quot;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/system:page-tags/tag/nameless#pages&quot;&gt;nameless&lt;/a&gt;&amp;quot; tag. It&#039;s not like it matters, but that&#039;s something to think about. Without further ado though, let&#039;s actually get to the contents of this page, shall we?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpper.com/user/5986843&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--resized-images/ralliston-s-authorpage/scplogo/medium.jpg&quot; width=&quot;45&quot; alt=&quot;scplogo&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt; | &lt;span style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&amp;#32;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Attendance.png&quot; alt=&quot;Attendance.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Orange.png&quot; alt=&quot;Orange.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Arrows.png&quot; alt=&quot;Arrows.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Scream.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Scream.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Media.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Media.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/TV.png&quot; alt=&quot;TV.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Cycle.jpg&quot; alt=&quot;Cycle.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt; &lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-achievement-badges/Apple.png&quot; alt=&quot;Apple.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-433180-3&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt; | &lt;a href=&quot;https://twitter.com/Ralliston1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;https://www.colorbook.io/img/icons/socialmedia/twitter.svg&quot; width