				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5129</link>
				<description>

&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: right;&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Item #:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5129&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Object Class:&lt;/strong&gt; Euclid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Special Containment Procedures:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5129 is to be stored in a 1m*1m*20cm reinforced steel locked crate that is to be accessible only to level 2+ personal.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description:&lt;/strong&gt; SCP-5129 resembles a standard M11 pistol that uses ordinary 9mm Parabellum bullets. When shot the bullet will create a spacial anomaly that allows any entity to travel from one place to another. The spatial anomalies that SCP-5129 creates are linked together making it possible to jump from one anomaly to the other. SCP-5129 can create a maximum of 2 anomalies at a time, attempting to make more will cause the oldest one to disappear. Reloading the gun will cause all anomalies to disappear. If any anomaly disappears near a living entity it will also disappear in an unknown place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footer-wikiwalk-nav&quot;&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;#171; &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5128&quot;&gt;SCP-5128&lt;/a&gt; | SCP-5129 | &lt;a href=&quot;http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5130&quot;&gt;SCP-5130&lt;/a&gt; &amp;#187;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/musca-alex&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7113272&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1608582170&quot; alt=&quot;Musca-Alex&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7113272)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/musca-alex&quot;  &gt;Musca-Alex&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 21 Dec 2020 16:40:25 +0000</pubDate>
												<content:encoded>
