&lt;h1&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #901;&quot;&gt;WARNING: THE FOLLOWING&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #080;&quot;&gt;FILE&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span style=&quot;color: #901;&quot;&gt;CONTAINS HAZARDOUS INFORMATION&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DO NOT PROCEED UNTIL YOU HAVE READ AND UNDERSTAND THE CONTENTS OF THE FOLLOWING DISCLAIMER.&lt;/strong&gt; If you are confused by the disclaimer, contact the nearest available Miscommunications personnel and do not discuss this &lt;span style=&quot;color: green&quot;&gt;FILE&lt;/span&gt;&#039;s contents unless you are answering a direct question.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
