&lt;td&gt;Site-15 Director. Note: instance is unique in that only proper-noun or title designations are corrected. Dr. Placeholder is legally unable to change this, as it is an objective fact that this is his name.&lt;sup class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;&gt;&lt;a id=&quot;footnoteref-345467-12&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot; class=&quot;footnoteref&quot;  &gt;12&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/sup&gt;&lt;/td&gt;
